# Windows text line endings are valid; Markdown uses two spaces for hard breaks.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Preserve Unity's generated empty YAML fields and diagnostic logs verbatim.
*.meta whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
